---
---

  <!-- ===== FAQ ===== -->
  <section class="py-24" style="background-color: #F8FAFC; border-top: 1px solid #E2E8F0;">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-14">
        <p
          class="uppercase mb-4"
          style="font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 500; font-size: 18px; line-height: 31px; letter-spacing: 1.63px; color: #2738C0;"
        >
          FAQ
        </p>
        <h2
          class="mb-4"
          style="font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 500; font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px); line-height: 41px; letter-spacing: 0; color: #0F172A;"
        >
          Frequently Asked
          <span
            class="inline-block"
            style="font-family: 'Segoe Script', 'Yellowtail', cursive; font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px); line-height: 41px; letter-spacing: 0; color: #2738C0; margin: 0 0.1em;"
          >Questions</span>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div x-data="{ open: null }" class="space-y-3">
        {[
          { q: 'What services do you offer?', a: 'We provide accounting, tax, payroll, financial reporting, and advisory services. This includes company formation, ongoing compliance, restructuring support, and assistance with business closure where required.' },
          { q: 'Do you work with businesses across the UK, USA, and UAE?', a: 'Yes. We support clients across all three markets with a clear understanding of local regulations, including HMRC, IRS, and UAE VAT and corporate tax requirements.' },
          { q: 'Do you support both businesses and individuals?', a: 'Yes. We work with companies as well as individuals, supporting business accounting, corporate tax, and personal tax requirements.' },
          { q: 'Can you work with our existing accounting setup?', a: 'Yes. We can work within your current systems, processes, and software, or help restructure and improve them where needed.' },
          { q: 'What accounting software do you work with?', a: 'We work with widely used platforms such as QuickBooks, Xero, NetSuite, Sage, and Zoho Books, along with supporting tools for payroll, reporting, and automation.' },
          { q: 'How do you ensure compliance across different countries?', a: 'Work is managed with an understanding of local regulations in each market, ensuring filings, reporting, and processes meet required standards in the UK, USA, and UAE.' },
          { q: 'How is data security handled?', a: 'Strict confidentiality and data security protocols are followed, including controlled access, secure data handling, and compliance with GDPR and relevant data protection standards.' },
          { q: 'What does the engagement process look like?', a: 'The process starts with understanding your requirements, followed by defining scope, onboarding, and ongoing execution with regular reporting and communication.' },
          { q: 'How is pricing structured?', a: 'Pricing depends on the scope of work, volume, and level of support required. Engagements are structured based on your business needs.' },
          { q: 'How do we get started?', a: 'You can book a consultation to discuss your requirements. Based on that, the scope and next steps are clearly outlined.' },
        ].map((faq, i) => (
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden hover:border-slate-200 transition-all">
            <button
              class="w-full flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-5 text-left"
              @click={`open = open === ${i} ? null : ${i}`}
            >
              <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">{faq.q}</span>
              <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 ml-4 transition-all" :class={`open === ${i} ? 'rotate-180' : ''`} style="background-color: #E8EEF7;">
                <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" style="color: #1a4480;" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
            </button>
            <div
              x-show={`open === ${i}`}
              x-transition:enter="transition ease-out duration-200"
              x-transition:enter-start="opacity-0 -translate-y-2"
              x-transition:enter-end="opacity-100 translate-y-0"
              x-transition:leave="transition ease-in duration-150"
              x-transition:leave-start="opacity-100 translate-y-0"
              x-transition:leave-end="opacity-0 -translate-y-2"
              style="display:none;"
            >
              <div class="px-6 pb-5">
                <div class="w-full h-px mb-4" style="background-color: #F1F5F9;"></div>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">{faq.a}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
